    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="6" relname="joint">Good start here, P45.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="8" relname="span">Also, everyone should check out Jakob Nielsen's Alertbox website.</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="2" relname="enablement">I believe I have a link to this on the HCI Website under HCI Exploration.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="9" relname="span">Nielsen is considered the "guru" of usability,</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="4" relname="elaboration">having defined the term in the early 90s and taking the lead on usability research as we know it today.</segment>
